      "side": 1,
      "message": "Did you mean to change this from `p.getEntryFileMode()`?\n```suggestion\n    if (p.eof() || !FileMode.TREE.equals(p.getEntryFileMode())) {\n```",
      "revId": "4db80928643072a95f17b71153a0f0e69cdb9d08",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
